SUMMARY:[SPLASH 2027 (OOPSLA)] R1 Paper Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Please submit using HotCRP: https://oopsla27.hotcrp.com/. Init
 ial submissions must be at most 23 pages\; revisions can go up to a maxim
 um of 25 pages. PACMPL uses double-blind reviewing. At least one author m
 ust be registered as a Reserve Reviewer. Papers rejected in Round 1 canno
 t be resubmitted in Round 2.\n\nSubmit at: https://oopsla27.hotcrp.com/\n
 \nExtracted automatically by a small language model\; please cross-check 
 against the source before relying on it: https://conf.researchr.org/track
 /splash-2027/splashoopsla2027\nhttps://github.com/JonasAlaif/pl-conferenc
